### Status geral / IA
GET http://localhost:3000/api/system/status

### Saúde
GET http://localhost:3000/api/health

### Estado atual da simulação
GET http://localhost:3000/api/simulation

### Avançar 1 dia
POST http://localhost:3000/api/simulation/advance
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "days": 1
}

### Avançar para o próximo evento
POST http://localhost:3000/api/simulation/next-event

### Reiniciar semestre
POST http://localhost:3000/api/simulation/reset

### Turmas
GET http://localhost:3000/api/classes

### Dashboard da turma
GET http://localhost:3000/api/classes/cc1a/dashboard

### Perfil completo da aluna-foco
GET http://localhost:3000/api/students/s1/profile

### Registrar falta manualmente
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/students/s1/subjects/fil
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "absences": 9
}

### Prévia dos e-mails atuais
GET http://localhost:3000/api/students/s1/notifications/preview

### Clustering não supervisionado
GET http://localhost:3000/api/classes/cc1a/clusters

### Histórico de notificações
GET http://localhost:3000/api/notifications


### Avançar 7 dias
POST http://localhost:3000/api/simulation/advance
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "days": 7
}
